462162868223_6141527655874204065_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWysYmS_VzkQ7kNvwFb-GXd&_nc_oc=Adrmuds8TaQK0vfzbV1qO4aDjRTO3DyWUJ9Z4RTcpagbMH6lycnwxpy9io8A6CyzQEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTGj6YEF7NHIebpcwB_jB-Wts2zSqGWMgEXSwg_x25k_Q&oe=6B0C75E4"}, "display_name": "RaceFault VR  Car Racing", "keywords": ["vrracing", "cardriftvr", "simracingvr", "racefault", "vrcarracing"], "long_description": "**RaceFault VR Car Racing**  \nThe official RaceFault VR Car Racing experience - where every screeching turn feels real!  \n\n## \ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES  \n- **6 HIGH-OCTANE CARS**: Sports, muscle & off-road beasts  \n- **DUAL ENVIRONMENTS**: Neon City Circuit + Wild Forest  \n- **10+ CHALLENGING LEVELS**: Time trials, eliminations & championships  \n- **INTELLIGENT AI**: Adapts to your driving style  \n- **TRUE VR IMMERSION**: Feel every drift in 360\u00b0  \n\n**Meta Quest Optimized**: Haptic feedback, realistic physics & anti-motion sickness tech. Dominate leaderboards in **RaceFault VR Car Racing** - the most visceral VR racing sim!", "short_description": "Burn rubber in hyper-immersive VR! Race 6 customizable cars across city streets and wild forest tracks against relentless AI. 10+ heart-pounding levels of drifting chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/racefault/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/racefault/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connec